  "prompt": "Trong hình vẽ bên dưới, một chiếc máy bay <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> bay ở độ cao <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>500</mn></semantics></math> m theo một đường thẳng đi ngang qua phía trên trạm quan sát <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>T</mi></semantics></math> ở mặt đất. Hình chiếu vuông góc của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> lên mặt đất là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>α</mi></semantics></math> là góc lượng giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/a92097b2a3864cbee40301a6ecb9efbfb6ae6ac90a3ab2ce407df7917bd14ba6.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Biểu diễn tọa độ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>H</mi></msub></semantics></math> của điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math> trên trục <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> theo <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>α</mi></semantics></math>.</li><li>Dựa vào đồ thị hàm số côtang, hãy cho biết với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> thì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>H</mi></msub></semantics></math> nằm trong khoảng nào? Làm tròn kết quả đến hàng phần mười.</li></ol>",
  "choices": [],
  "correct": null,
  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Coi trạm quan sát <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>T</mi></semantics></math> là gốc tọa độ thì ta có\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>H</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cot</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>500</mn><mo>cot</mo><mi>α</mi><mspace width=\"0.278em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mtext><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div></li><li><div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Dựa vào đồ thị hàm số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cot</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, ta thấy với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> thì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>cot</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>500</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>H</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>500</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>. Làm tròn kết quả đến hàng phần mười ta được\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>288</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>H</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>866</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div></div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/e61a18e4f31cfc266b95b6a7115482b5a8f6d1c8f6a1d1742f417d60489538cf.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div></li></ol>",
